%%{init: {'themeVariables': {'fontFamily': 'Noto Sans SC, Microsoft YaHei, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, SimHei, Arial, sans-serif'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend(App/ExecutionBoard)
    participant API as ApiService(api.ts)
    participant BE as FastAPI Routers
    participant SVC as BloombergEMSXService
    participant EMSX as Bloomberg EMSX
    participant WS as Realtime Gateway(WebSocket)

    Note over U,WS: T0 用户进入 ExecutionView 页面

    U->>FE: 打开 ExecutionView 标签页
    activate FE

    Note over FE: T1 触发初始加载
    par 初始数据加载
        FE->>API: getOrders()
        activate API
        API->>BE: GET /api/orders
        activate BE
        BE->>SVC: get_orders(filters)
        activate SVC
        SVC->>EMSX: 读取订单缓存/补充字段
        activate EMSX
        EMSX-->>SVC: 订单数据
        deactivate EMSX
        SVC-->>BE: order list
        deactivate SVC
        BE-->>API: ApiResponse<Order[]>
        deactivate BE
        API-->>FE: orders
        deactivate API
    and 路由数据加载
        FE->>API: getRoutes()
        activate API
        API->>BE: GET /api/routes
        activate BE
        BE->>SVC: get_routes(filters)
        activate SVC
        SVC->>EMSX: 读取路由缓存/补充字段
        activate EMSX
        EMSX-->>SVC: 路由数据
        deactivate EMSX
        SVC-->>BE: route list
        deactivate SVC
        BE-->>API: ApiResponse<Route[]>
        deactivate BE
        API-->>FE: routes
        deactivate API
    and 交易员信息
        FE->>API: getTraderInfo()
        activate API
        API->>BE: GET /api/trader-info
        activate BE
        BE->>SVC: get_terminal_trader_name()
        activate SVC
        SVC-->>BE: trader
        deactivate SVC
        BE-->>API: ApiResponse<trader>
        deactivate BE
        API-->>FE: trader
        deactivate API
    end

    Note over FE: T2 订单表/路由表渲染完成

    opt 实时流开启
        FE->>WS: 建立 WS 连接 (/api/realtime/ws)
        activate WS
        WS-->>FE: snapshot + cursor
        alt WS 中断
            FE-->>FE: 启动轮询退避(2s~5s)
            FE->>API: fetchOrdersAndRoutes()
            API->>BE: GET /api/orders + /api/routes
            BE-->>API: 最新数据
            API-->>FE: 刷新界面
        else WS 正常
            WS-->>FE: 增量事件(order/route updates)
        end
        deactivate WS
    end

    deactivate FE
    Note over U,WS: T3 用户看到最新执行状态